    "innovation": "Using novel techniques to measure iron solubility from Antarctic ice cores at more realistic pH levels, this paper shows that soluble aerosol iron fluxes to the Southern Ocean during the Last Glacial Maximum were significantly higher and more variable than climate models typically assume.",
