            "relation": "MEASURES_VARIABLE",
            "target_entity_instance": "Deuterium (\u03b4D) ratios",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "The ice core at Berkner Island was drilled to bedrock, and completed in 2005 (ref. 65 and Fig. 2). Deuterium (\u03b4D) ratios (expressed relative to the international standard Vienna Standard Mean Ocean Water) were measured at the NERC Isotope Geosciences Laboratory using standard methods66 and have a typical precision of 1.0\u2030.",
